      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] 🔴 The patch also deletes the `for linkunit in $LIBRARY_LIST; do ... prepend ${linkunit}_extralibs ... done` aggregation step from `configure`. In static/minimal builds this is a core mechanism that propagates component-level extra libs into final link lines; removing it can cause unresolved symbols and cross-platform link breakage. Restore this loop (or gate any workaround strictly behind a Windows/MSVC condition) so non-Windows targets keep upstream link dependency resolution.",
