      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 14: 🔴 `require_pkg_config()` is globally neutered by commenting out `check_pkg_config ... || die ...`. This converts hard dependency checks into silent success for every pkg-config-gated library, which can produce misconfigured binaries or late link/runtime failures that are hard to diagnose (and can mask missing security-related libs). Keep this override narrowly scoped to the specific Windows-only problematic deps (as done in `windows-configure-ffnvcodec.patch`) instead of disabling the core guardrail globally.",
      "revId": "276b67caa259aa3744aad712619b5dab4c7425d9",
